OL,3,GNEWSAWest Midlands floods close theme
OL,4,Apark, bring pub chaos and see people
OL,5,A'lose everything'
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Significant flooding" hits Birmingham
OL,8,Fand Staffordshire
OL,10,FOther parts of the West Midlands also
OL,11,Fdeal with fallout from the weather
OL,13,FOne business owner says she has "lost
OL,14,Feverything"
OL,16,FShe describes the weather as "ungodly"
OL,18,F"Flood water was a river - I watched it
OL,19,Fcoming round the corner"
OL,21,FTheme park Drayton Manor closes
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
