OL,4,Apark, bring pub chaos and see people
OL,5,A'lose everything'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPubs among places to suffer, with one
OL,8,Fseeing water knee-high
OL,10,FOne pub manager called a "star" after
OL,11,Fevacuations at their premises
OL,13,FLichfield records the highest rainfall
OL,14,Fnationwide
OL,16,FRail line floods, disrupting services
OL,18,FThe Met Office has a yellow warning of
OL,19,Fthunderstorms in place for the region
OL,20,Funtil Thursday night, with some
OL,21,Fdisruption anticipated
